    "detailed_description": "It's 1944, D-Day a section of British paratroopers assault a gun emplacement German occupied France. But when a soldier mysteriously disappears, you enter an old manor house in search of the missing comrade, the horrors of its past begin to haunt the new occupants within its walls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385330/extras/4986ecc7941390d389c04077ae515be8.avif?t=1698777940\" /></span><br><br>You play as Alfred Stuart a sergeant in the British Parachute regiment. Emiline: The Ghost of White Willow is a gripping VR survival horror game set in 1944, where players step into the boots of a British paratrooper who miraculously survives a harrowing landing in Normandy. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385330/extras/1856e536024499a0472c6e98db303860.avif?t=1698777940\" /></span><br><br>Whilst missing your unit, you must establish radio communication with the next section, you must navigate a sinister haunted house, desperately searching for a missing comrade. Unbeknownst to you, the vengeful spirit of Marrion, fuelled by a tragic love triangle with her husband and the maid Emiline, seeks to capture and exact revenge on the player, who she believes stole her prized gold, leading to a spine-chilling battle for survival and uncovering the house's dark secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385330/extras/67c5200e7bb2492d1af55d484603e443.avif?t=1698777940\" /></span><br><br>A gothic horror where love, betrayal and murder haunt every corner, the only way to survive is to embrace the darkness, face your fears, and grab your torch to reveal the truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385330/extras/6652edcc0687011c06485030b2dbd827.avif?t=1698777940\" /></span>",
